The '''Spider Mound''' is a sub-location of the {{Zone|Spider's Den}}.

{{ZoneText|Scale the structure.|Slay Spiders.}}

== Features ==
The '''Spider Mound''' features various attractions.

=== Broodmother ===
{{Main|Broodmother}}
The {{MobSprite|Broodmother}} is a {{mcat|mb}} that spawns at the top of the '''Spider Mound'''. It spawns a swarm of {{MobSprite|Cave Spider}}s when defeated. It will respawn after {{Green|10}} minutes.

